<title>CANADA: AZCO affiliate sets Mali exploration.</title>
<headline>AZCO affiliate sets Mali exploration.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, B.C. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AZCO Mining Inc said Thursday 51 percent owned SANOU Mining Corp has received a favorable geological evaluation of its Malian gold concessions and has budgeted US $1.8 million for exploration.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
